"note": "Exact text of the Phase 5I homepage (aa4ace1-era markup, byte for byte), kept so that older byte-identity tests can keep comparing the rest of the page after Phase 5J replaced it. Used only by tests/legacy_5i.js.",
"region1": "<header>\n<h1>A simple end-of-day stock screener for Indian swing traders</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">This page is your working plan plus a live demo for swing traders (people who hold stocks for days to weeks): what to build, in what order, what it costs and what to watch out for. Name \"StockLens India\" is a placeholder; pick your own.</p>\n<a class=\"btn\" href=\"#road\">See the roadmap</a>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"stat\" style=\"padding-left:0\"></p>\n</header>\n\n<h2 id=\"demo\">Demo: swing scans (updated after market close)</h2>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"tabs\"></div>\n<div class=\"scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>LTP (\u20b9)</th><th>Change %</th><th>Volume vs avg</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"rows\"></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"dnote\">Sample numbers only, not real market data. Real data comes from a paid data provider (see Costs).</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"margin-top:14px;padding:16px\">\n<h3>Market breadth (sample): advance / decline</h3>\n<div class=\"bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1180 advancing, 60 unchanged, 760 declining\"><i style=\"width:59%;background:var(--up)\"></i><i style=\"width:3%;background:var(--line)\"></i><i style=\"width:38%;background:var(--dn)\"></i></div>\n<div id=\"adtxt\"><span class=\"up\">1,180 advancing</span> &nbsp; <span style=\"color:var(--mute)\">60 flat</span> &nbsp; <span class=\"dn\">760 declining</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"all\">Everything in one place</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">I could not open the widgets inside your Chartink link (it only showed the title, \"Market Breadth Dashboard\"). So this section covers what that kind of dashboard usually has, plus the gainers, losers, volume, highs, technical and fundamental scans you asked for.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:1.2em\">Market breadth (sample)</h3>\n<div class=\"tiles\" id=\"tiles\"></div>\n<div class=\"g\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Gainers and losers</h3><ul><li>Top gainers / top losers today</li><li>Up or down 4%+ with high volume</li><li>Gap up / gap down at open</li><li>Weekly and monthly gainers</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Volume</h3><ul><li>Volume 2x or more of the 20-day average</li><li>Highest traded value (\u20b9) today</li><li>Quiet stocks about to move (low volume dry-up)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Highs and lows</h3><ul><li>52-week high / 52-week low</li><li>All-time high</li><li>Near 52-week high (within 5%)</li><li>20-day high breakout</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Technical</h3><ul><li>Above 20 / 50 / 200 day average</li><li>Golden cross, MACD crossover</li><li>RSI above 60 or below 30</li><li>Supertrend, inside bar, Bollinger squeeze</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Fundamental</h3><ul><li>PE, market cap, dividend yield</li><li>ROE, ROCE, debt to equity</li><li>Sales and profit growth</li><li>Promoter holding, quarterly results</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Sectors</h3><ul><li>Sector gainers and losers</li><li>Sector strength this week and month</li><li>Stocks above 50 DMA per sector</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:1.4em\">Fundamental screen</h3>\n<p id=\"fstat\" class=\"note\" style=\"padding-left:0\">Loading fundamentals\u2026</p>\n<p style=\"margin:.3em 0 .6em;color:var(--mute)\">Show me stocks with ROE above: <select id=\"roe\"><option value=\"0\">Any</option><option value=\"15\" selected>15%</option><option value=\"20\">20%</option><option value=\"25\">25%</option></select></p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"ftabs\" style=\"padding:0 0 10px;border:0\"></div>\n<div id=\"ftab1\"><div class=\"panel scroll\"><table id=\"ftable\"><thead><tr>\n<th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"symbol\">Stock</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"company_name\">Company</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"sector\">Sector</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"pe\">P/E</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"pb\">P/B</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"roe\">ROE %</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"roce\">ROCE %</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"roa\">ROA %</button></th><th><button class=\"lk\" data-k=\"ev_ebitda\">EV/EBITDA</button></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"fund\"></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"note\">Real company data from Upstox. A dash (-) means Upstox did not provide that value.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"ftab2\" hidden><p class=\"note finstat\" style=\"padding-left:0\">Loading financial statements\u2026</p>\n<h4 style=\"margin:.6em 0 .4em\">Earnings (latest annual period)</h4><div class=\"panel scroll\" id=\"t2a\"></div>\n<h4 style=\"margin:1.2em 0 .4em\">Returns and valuation</h4><div class=\"panel scroll\" id=\"t2b\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"vstat\" style=\"padding-left:0\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"margin:1.2em 0 .4em\">Balance sheet</h4><div class=\"panel scroll\" id=\"t2\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"n2\" style=\"padding-left:0\"></p></div>\n<div id=\"ftab3\" hidden><p class=\"note finstat\" style=\"padding-left:0\">Loading financial statements\u2026</p>\n<h4 style=\"margin:.6em 0 .4em\">Cash flow (latest annual period)</h4><div class=\"panel scroll\" id=\"t3a\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"fcfnote\" style=\"padding-left:0\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"margin:1.2em 0 .4em\">Growth (latest year, change vs previous year as reported by Upstox)</h4><div class=\"panel scroll\" id=\"t3b\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"n3\" style=\"padding-left:0\"></p></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"more\">More market data</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Six extra views swing traders check every evening. Each has a one-line explanation so beginners can follow.</p>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"mt\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"mx\" style=\"padding-bottom:0\"></p>\n<div class=\"scroll\"><table><thead id=\"mh\"></thead><tbody id=\"mb\"></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"note\">Sample numbers and made-up investor names only. Real data comes from the daily exchange files and your data vendor.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"news\">News and filings: yesterday's company updates</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Every item comes from an official company filing on the exchange, rewritten in two plain lines. Tap a tag to filter.</p>\n<div class=\"chips\" id=\"chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter by type\"></div>\n<div id=\"feed\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\">All companies, amounts and dates below are made up for the demo. Real items must link to the original filing and be checked before they go live.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"stock\">Filings for this stock</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Tap any stock name in the scan table above, or choose one here.</p>\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"padding:16px\">\n<label for=\"sp\" style=\"color:var(--mute);font-size:.9rem\">Stock </label><select id=\"sp\"></select>\n<div class=\"tiles\" id=\"snap\"></div>\n<div class=\"chips\" id=\"sf\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter filings\"></div>\n<div class=\"tl\" id=\"tl\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\" style=\"padding-left:0\">Sample data. In the real product each line links to the original exchange filing.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"tools\">Strength, delivery, big deals and FII/DII</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Six more tools swing traders use every evening. Choose a tab.</p>\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"tabs\" role=\"tablist\" id=\"ttabs\"></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"tdesc\" style=\"padding-bottom:0\"></p>\n<div class=\"scroll\"><table><thead id=\"thead\"></thead><tbody id=\"tbody\"></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"note\" id=\"xnote\">Sample numbers and made-up investor names. Delivery %, bulk/block deals and FII/DII figures are published by the exchanges after market close. Relative strength and moving averages you calculate yourself from price data. Check the exchanges' terms before showing their reports on your site.</p></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"road\">Roadmap: step by step</h2>\n<div class=\"g\">\n<div class=\"c\"><small>Weeks 1\u20132 \u00b7 Plan</small><h3>Validate and set up</h3><ul><li>Niche is set: swing traders who hold for days to weeks</li><li>Talk to 20 traders, ask what they pay for today</li><li>Register company, buy domain, talk to a CA/lawyer about SEBI</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><small>Weeks 3\u201312 \u00b7 Build</small><h3>MVP (first version)</h3><ul><li>End-of-day data from a licensed vendor (no live feed needed)</li><li>4 pages: Swing scans, Market breadth, Sector strength, Watchlist</li><li>Login, free vs paid plan, payments</li><li>Fast web app that works well on mobile</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><small>Months 4\u20136 \u00b7 Launch</small><h3>Go live</h3><ul><li>Beta with 100 users, fix bugs</li><li>YouTube, Telegram, X, WhatsApp communities</li><li>Weekly market-breadth posts to build trust</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><small>Months 7\u201312 \u00b7 Grow</small><h3>Add depth</h3><ul><li>Evening Telegram/email digest, custom scans, chart patterns</li><li>% of stocks above 50/200 DMA, FII/DII, results calendar</li><li>Broker tie-ups, mobile app</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><small>Year 2 \u00b7 Scale</small><h3>Become a brand</h3><ul><li>Backtesting, API for developers</li><li>Hindi and regional language versions</li><li>Education courses, B2B for brokers</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"cost\">Expected spending (India, rough estimates)</h2>\n<div class=\"panel scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Cost</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Developers (freelance / small agency)</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b91.5\u20134 lakh</td><td>3-month MVP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Design (logo, UI)</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b930\u201360k</td><td>One-time</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Market data (end-of-day)</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b9500\u20135k / month</td><td>Much cheaper than live F&amp;O data</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cloud servers, database, domain</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b93\u201310k / month</td><td>Start small, scale later</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Company registration, legal, disclaimers</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b920\u201350k</td><td>Plus yearly CA fees</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Marketing (first 6 months)</td><td class=\"n\">\u20b91\u20133 lakh</td><td>Content beats ads at the start</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Total to launch</b></td><td class=\"n\"><b>\u20b94\u20139 lakh</b></td><td>Year 1 including running costs: about \u20b98\u201318 lakh</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"note\">Get 2\u20133 quotes for every item. Exact vendor prices change, so confirm before paying.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"money\">How you earn</h2>\n<div class=\"g\">\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Subscriptions</h3><p>Free plan with delay and limits. Pro at about \u20b9299\u2013999/month. This is your main income.</p></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Broker referrals</h3><p>Earn when users open demat accounts. Always disclose it clearly.</p></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Evening alerts and API</h3><p>Paid daily scan digests on Telegram or email, plus data access for developers.</p></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>Education</h3><p>Courses and webinars on reading OI, breadth and pivots.</p></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"note\">Rough goal: 1,000 paying users \u00d7 \u20b9500 = \u20b95 lakh/month. Most sites need 12\u201324 months to get there.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"pc\">Pros and cons</h2>\n<div class=\"g\">\n<div class=\"c pro\"><h3>Pros</h3><ul><li>Millions of new demat accounts in India</li><li>Repeat subscriptions, users come daily</li><li>End-of-day data keeps running costs low</li><li>Content and SEO bring free users</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c con\"><h3>Cons</h3><ul><li>Crowded: Intraday Screener, Chartink, Screener.in already exist</li><li>Swing traders visit once a day, so you need evening alerts to bring them back</li><li>Users leave quickly if data is late or wrong</li><li>Strict SEBI rules; a bad month for markets means fewer users</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"c\"><h3>How to win</h3><ul><li>Choose a narrow niche and do it better</li><li>Simple Hindi and English explanations</li><li>Very fast pages, clean mobile view</li><li>Honest, no-tips, education-first brand</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"law\">Rules you must follow</h2>\n<div class=\"warn\"><ul>\n<li>Do not say \"buy\" or \"sell\" or give targets unless you are a SEBI-registered Research Analyst or Investment Adviser. Show data, not advice.</li>\n<li>Do not copy exchange data or another site's data. Use a licensed vendor.</li>\n<li>Add a risk disclaimer, privacy policy and terms on every page.</li>\n<li>Follow SEBI rules on influencers and paid promotions. Disclose affiliate links.</li>\n<li>Check the current rules with a lawyer before launch; they change often.</li>\n</ul></div>\n\n",
"footer": "<footer>Sample plan for learning purposes. Not financial or legal advice. Market figures on this page are dummy data.</footer>",
"script0": "<script>\nvar LIVE=false;\nconst D={\n\"Breakout\":[[\"GLENMARK\",2441.5,4.98,2.4],[\"MANKIND\",2545,4.49,1.9],[\"SONACOMS\",815.65,3.1,2.8]],\n\"Pullback to 20 EMA\":[[\"TORNTPHARM\",4894,0.51,0.8],[\"ADANIPOWER\",196.3,0.4,0.9],[\"DEMO BANK\",640.2,-0.3,0.7]],\n\"52-Week High\":[[\"SAMPLE CO\",980,2.2,3.1],[\"TEST AUTO\",2210,1.6,2.2],[\"DEMO STEEL\",145.5,3.4,1.7]],\n\"Volume Surge\":[[\"XYZ INDS\",1204,1.2,4.6],[\"ABC LTD\",312.4,0.6,3.9],[\"GLENMARK\",2441.5,4.98,2.4]],\n\"Near Support\":[[\"PQR PHARMA\",455,-0.8,0.6],[\"LMN TECH\",1320,-1.1,0.9],[\"DEMO BANK\",640.2,-0.3,0.7]]};\nconst tabs=document.getElementById(\"tabs\"),rows=document.getElementById(\"rows\");\nfunction show(k){[...tabs.children].forEach(b=>b.setAttribute(\"aria-selected\",b.textContent===k));\nrows.innerHTML=D[k].map(r=>`<tr><td><button class=\"lk\" type=\"button\">${r[0]}</button>${LIVE?\"\":'<span class=\"tag\">SAMPLE</span>'}</td><td class=\"n\">${r[1].toFixed(2)}</td><td class=\"n ${r[2]>=0?\"up\":\"dn\"}\">${r[2]>=0?\"\u25b2\":\"\u25bc\"} ${Math.abs(r[2]).toFixed(2)}</td><td class=\"n\">${r[3].toFixed(1)}\u00d7</td></tr>`).join(\"\")}\nObject.keys(D).forEach(k=>{const b=document.createElement(\"button\");b.textContent=k;b.setAttribute(\"role\",\"tab\");b.onclick=()=>show(k);tabs.appendChild(b)});\nshow(\"Breakout\");\n\nconst T=[[\"Above 20 DMA\",58],[\"Above 50 DMA\",46],[\"Above 200 DMA\",52],[\"New 52-week highs\",41,1],[\"New 52-week lows\",17,1],[\"Up 4%+ today\",63,1],[\"Down 4%+ today\",38,1],[\"Advance/decline ratio\",1.6,1]];\ndocument.getElementById(\"tiles\").innerHTML=T.map(t=>`<div class=\"tile\"><b>${t[0].includes(\"ratio\")?t[1].toFixed(1):t[1]+(t[2]?\"\":\"%\")}</b><span>${t[0]}</span>${t[2]?\"\":`<div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"width:${t[1]}%\"></i></div>`}</div>`).join(\"\");\nlet FD=[],fsort={k:\"roe\",dir:-1};\nconst fesc=t=>String(t).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,c=>({\"&\":\"&amp;\",\"<\":\"&lt;\",\">\":\"&gt;\",'\"':\"&quot;\"}[c]));\nconst ffmt=v=>v==null?\"-\":v.toLocaleString(\"en-IN\",{maximumFractionDigits:2});\nfunction fund(){const m=+document.getElementById(\"roe\").value,b=document.getElementById(\"fund\");\nconst r=FD.filter(x=>m===0||(x.roe!=null&&x.roe>=m));\nr.sort((a,c)=>{const A=a[fsort.k],B=c[fsort.k];if(A==null&&B==null)return 0;if(A==null)return 1;if(B==null)return -1;return typeof A===\"string\"?A.localeCompare(B)*fsort.dir:(A-B)*fsort.dir});\nb.innerHTML=r.length?r.map(x=>`<tr><td>${fesc(x.symbol)}</td><td>${x.company_name?fesc(x.company_name):\"-\"}</td><td>${x.sector?fesc(x.sector):\"-\"}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.pe)}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.pb)}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.roe)}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.roce)}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.roa)}</td><td class=\"n\">${ffmt(x.ev_ebitda)}</td></tr>`).join(\"\"):'<tr><td colspan=\"9\">No stocks match. Lower the ROE.</td></tr>'}\ndocument.getElementById(\"roe\").onchange=fund;\ndocument.querySelectorAll(\"#ftable [data-k]\").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const k=b.dataset.k;fsort=fsort.k===k?{k,dir:-fsort.dir}:{k,dir:typeof (FD[0]||{})[k]===\"string\"?1:-1};fund()});\n(async()=>{const st=document.getElementById(\"fstat\");\ntry{const r=await fetch(\"out/fundamentals.json\",{cache:\"no-store\"});if(!r.ok)throw new Error(\"missing\");const j=await r.json();\nif(!j||!Array.isArray(j.stocks)||!j.stocks.length)throw new Error(\"empty\");FD=j.stocks;\nst.textContent=\"Fundamentals data: \"+j.source+\" \u00b7 Updated: \"+j.as_of}\ncatch(e){st.textContent=\"Fundamentals not loaded yet.\";document.getElementById(\"fund\").innerHTML='<tr><td colspan=\"9\">Fundamentals not loaded yet.</td></tr>';return}\nfund()})();\n\nconst N=[\n[\"Orders\",\"SAMPLE ENGINEERING\",\"Wins a \u20b9850 crore order from a state power company.\",\"Work to be finished in 24 months.\",\"Order book filing\",\"28 Sep, 6:40 pm\"],\n[\"Orders\",\"DEMO INFRA\",\"Gets a \u20b9310 crore road project from a national agency.\",\"Project is 12% of last year's sales.\",\"Exchange filing\",\